{"id": "stackoverflow:comment:141182459", "source": "stackexchange", "site": "stackoverflow", "source_type": "comment", "source_id": 141182459, "parent_post_id": 80006102, "url": "https://stackoverflow.com/posts/80006102#comment141182459_80006102", "autor": "Aaqibhafeez Khan", "author_url": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/33070991/aaqibhafeez-khan", "author_id": 33070991, "canal": "stackoverflow", "idioma_sitio": "en", "titulo": "", "texto": "That makes sense. I was treating PENDING as safe to retry, but you're right that it doesn't tell me whether the provider call never happened or succeeded just before the crash.    Using a deterministic identifier/tag derived from the idempotency key gives me a way to recover the ambiguous case without relying on provider-side idempotency.    I hadn't considered recovering PENDING through lookup/adoption rather than immediately retrying the create request. Thanks, this addresses the failure window I was mainly concerned about.", "text_sha256": "ed1007b66383bb8114f43034f6b59404de79fef9b055af6fee8a04a7e59bbb14", "created_utc": "2026-09-27T21:36:54+00:00", "fetched_utc": "2026-09-28T02:27:14.509702+00:00", "license_api": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "license_method": "api", "license_policy_url": "https://stackoverflow.com/help/licensing", "tags": [], "score": 0, "answer_count": null, "view_count": null, "is_answered": null, "source_label": "comentario", "source_label_method": "api_endpoint", "faq_candidate": false, "faq_frequency_verified": false, "is_synthetic": false, "raw_file": "data/raw/stackoverflow/comments/0001.json", "transformations": "HTML to text, entities decoded; title prepended for questions; no translation", "thread_id": "stackoverflow:80005967", "thread_resolution": "answer_parent_api", "normalized_text_sha256": "adfd0c377c34ac6ec16a11d76fecb1b76a36e9a71be8c7309112fb8836e822ca", "duplicate_of": null, "split_group": "stackoverflow:80005967", "split": "train", "annotation": {"id": "stackoverflow:comment:141182459", "intencion": "logro", "sentimiento": "positivo", "es_testimonio": true, "es_logro": true, "confianza": 1.0, "evidencia": "Thanks, this addresses the failure window I was mainly concerned about.", "evidence_verified": true, "annotation_method": "gemini_silver", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "prompt_sha256": "1e177fdd9f91f7abad2e4252b7b3a3059c82eec162eb9d1daf39076a442b7ac5", "annotated_utc": "2026-09-28T02:42:25.063155+00:00", "text_sha256": "ed1007b66383bb8114f43034f6b59404de79fef9b055af6fee8a04a7e59bbb14", "human_reviewed": false, "label_scope": "full_comment"}, "intencion": "logro", "sentimiento": "positivo", "es_testimonio": true, "es_logro": true, "annotation_status": "silver_unreviewed", "needs_priority_review": false, "eligible_silver_training": true}
